Subject: Keep a device frame count the hint asks for, and mix at 48 kHz on Switch
Upstream-base: fbe120f5020f8bdcb9cbf5ae28d9859b29781119

The host's AI tests ask for 441-frame device pulls with
SDL_HINT_AUDIO_DEVICE_SAMPLE_FRAMES, which SDL3 honours. A device opened with
the hint set no longer lets SDL2 round the size to a power of two; SDL2
rebuffers instead. On Switch the device is asked for 48000 Hz, the rate the
console's audio renderer mixes at, so the console does not resample again.

